at if I pay in my preferred currency and need to return something?",style:["BOLD"]}],"faqMap.A4":[{type:"ST",text:"When you pay in your preferred currency, you lock in the current conversion rate at checkout. So when you need to return an item, you no longer have worry about rate fluctuations and are guaranteed to get back what you paid for, minus any processing fees (if applicable)."}],"faqMap.Q5":[{type:"ST",text:"Can I buy items listed in different currencies and check out with them all at once?",style:["BOLD"]}],"faqMap.A5":[{type:"ST",text:"No, you will need to complete separate checkouts for items with different original listing currencies, even though prices display in your preferred currency in the cart. There's a banner reminding you if this applies."}],"faqMap.EUQ1":[{type:"ST",text:"How much is eBay's currency conversion fee?",style:["BOLD"]}],"faqMap.EUA1":[{type:"ST",text:"Item prices include a "},{type:"DPH",value:"rate"},{type:"ST",text:"% conversion fee in addition to today's conversion rate."},{type:"ES",text:"\n"},{type:"ES",text:"\n"},{type:"ST",text:"Conversion fees are only added to item prices for international listings. For example, if you live and shop in the EU, your item prices won't include a conversion fee."}],"tab.currencySetting":[{type:"ST",text:"Currency setting"}],"tab.Faqs":[{type:"ST",text:"FAQs"}],preferredCurrencyDescription:[{type:"ST",text:"Your current preferred currency"}],originalListingCurrency:[{type:"ST",text:"Original listing currency"}],listingCurrencyDescription:[{type:"ST",text:"You'll see item prices in the listing currency"}],continueButtonText:[{type:"ST",text:"Continue in "},{type:"DPH",value:"currency"}],searchHint:[{type:"ST",text:"Find"}],errorMessage:[{type:"ST",text:"We're unable to load this page right now. Try refreshing or check back later."}],updateUserCurrencyPreferenceError:[{type:"ST",text:"We're unable to update your currency preference right now. Please try again."}],tryAgain:[{type:"ST",text:"Try ag